  "question": {
    "text": "Consider following reactions:<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0011_57b081ccef37.png\" style=\"width:2.83333in;height:1.07986in\" /><br />\rThe sum of molecular masses of gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is ____________ <math><mi>u</mi><mo>.</mo></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "46",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></math> is hydrogen gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math> Molecular mass of <math><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>u</mtext></math><br />Gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></math> is carbon dioxide <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> .<br />Molecular mass of <math><msub><mrow><mtext>CO</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mtext>&nbsp;u</mtext></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mtext> Sum</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>46</mn><mtext>&nbsp;u</mtext></math>"
  }
